document.querySelector('main').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<section class="view" id="ground"><div class="card"><h3>法域与题库状态</h3><select id="jurisdiction" class="sel"><option value="CN">中国 ESG 企业实务</option><option value="EU">EU / CBAM</option><option value="INT">国际</option><option value="TW">台湾地区</option><option value="ALL">综合</option></select><p id="gtCounts"></p><p>既有题目与知识点保留，来源版本、条款与生效日期尚未逐题核验。原刷题与模考为本地练习，成绩不作为认证结果。</p><button class="btn soft" id="exportGT">导出 Ground Truth 数据</button> <button class="btn soft" id="exportPrompt">导出 AI 出题指令</button> <button class="btn soft" id="exportProgress">导出进度备份</button><label class="btn soft">恢复 V3.1 备份<input type="file" id="restoreProgress" accept="application/json" hidden></label></div><div class="card section"><h3>七种题型 · 交互演示</h3><p>以下为虚构工厂的流程与算术样例，仅用于验收交互，不属于官方法规定论。</p><select class="sel" id="demoType"></select><div id="demoQuestion"></div></div><div class="card section"><h3>知识点弱点与熟练度</h3><p>熟练度 = 最近 20 次作答正确率；少于 5 次标记为证据不足。旧版成绩保留，不补造逐题答案。</p><div id="mastery31"></div></div></section><section class="view" id="account"><div class="card"><h3>账户与云端连接</h3><p id="authStatus">未配置 Supabase · 本地访客模式</p><p>填写项目 URL 与公开 publishable / anon key。不得填写 service_role 或 secret key。</p><input class="search" id="sbUrl" placeholder="https://项目.supabase.co"><input class="search" id="sbKey" placeholder="公开 publishable / anon key"><button class="btn soft" id="connect31">连接</button><hr><input class="search" id="email31" type="email" autocomplete="username" placeholder="邮箱"><input class="search" id="password31" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="密码"><button class="btn primary" id="login31">登录</button> <button class="btn soft" id="logout31">退出</button><p><button class="btn soft" id="forgot31">发送安全重设邮件</button></p><div id="recovery31" hidden><input class="search" id="newPassword31" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="新密码（至少12位）"><button class="btn primary" id="reset31">保存新密码</button></div><button class="btn soft" id="sync31">备份我的进度到云端</button> <button class="btn soft" id="pull31">恢复我的云端进度</button><p id="cloudStatus"></p></div><div class="card section"><h3>内容治理管理端</h3><p id="role31">角色未验证，管理功能锁定。</p><div id="admin31" hidden><p>可将旧题结构上传为待审核草稿。发布审批必须补齐来源证据，由后端检查。</p><button class="btn primary" id="uploadDraft31">上传前 20 题为待审核草稿</button></div></div></section>`);
